A previous update (https://rzlc.llnl.gov/gitlab/GRP/grape/-/merge_requests/793) updated GRAPE to stop creating/updating GitLab approval rules when grape review was run since the developer role no longer has permissions to do so. However, it would still try to delete old approval rules, which those with the developer role can't do either. Also, querying the server for approval rules and attempting to delete them slows grape review down. This merge request updates GRAPE to ignore GitLab approval rules completely.


